{"sections":{"hero_banner_w6LNcJ":{"type":"hero-banner","blocks":{"slide_JkMr6B":{"type":"slide","settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/built-diy-deck-kits-for-mobile-homes.png","background_gradient":"rgba(0,0,0,0.60)","preheading":"","preheading_class":"richtext-md","heading":"<h1><strong>Professional-Grade Pre-Built DIY Deck Kits for Mobile Homes<\/strong><\/h1>","heading_class":"richtext-md","subheading":"<p>A-DIY's freestanding deck kits for mobile homes are engineered to fit any mobile home entry height, require no attachment to your structure, and assemble with just a power drill. Join 50,000+ mobile homeowners who built their own deck and saved up to 40%.<br\/><br\/><strong>✓ <\/strong>Freestanding, No Attachment to Home Required<\/p><p><strong>✓ <\/strong>Fits Standard Mobile Home Entry Heights (15\"–43\")<\/p><p><strong>✓ <\/strong>Assembles in Under 1 Hour<\/p><p><strong>✓ <\/strong>Take It With You If You Move<\/p>","subheading_class":"richtext-md Rv-Deck-page-Subheading","button_primary_text":"Shop Mobile Home Deck Kits","button_primary_url":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/shop\/","button_primary_class":"button-secondary","button_secondary_text":"Get a Free Design Consultation","button_secondary_url":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/pages\/design-consultation-1","button_secondary_class":"button-secondary-outline","text_color":"#ffffff","text_align":"text-left","vertical_align_desktop":"md:justify-center","vertical_align":"justify-start","horizontal_align":"items-start mr-auto","vertical_padding":"0\/60px | 60px"}}},"block_order":["slide_JkMr6B"],"settings":{"top_bottom_min_height":"0 | 0 | 680px\/510px","full_screen":false,"section_id":"","container_spacing":"px-container-fullwidth","responsive_visibility":""}},"media_with_text_pGMTFF":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"image_AhqxAV":{"type":"image","settings":{"desktop_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/your-home-deserves-an-outdoor-space-youre-proud-of-diy-kits.png"}},"richtext_QAiRGa":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"<h2><strong>Your Home Deserves an Outdoor Space You're Proud Of<\/strong><\/h2>","richtext_class":"richtext-md","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"md:mb-3","margin_bottom_mobile":"mb-3"}},"richtext_PLzKaY":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"stars":false,"text":"<p>Mobile home living doesn't mean settling for a set of wobbly steps and bare ground outside your door. You've built a home worth being proud of, and it deserves a deck to match.<\/p><p><\/p><p>The problem? Most deck kits were designed for houses on concrete slabs. They don't account for mobile home heights, park regulations, or the fact that you might want to take your deck with you someday.<\/p><p><\/p><p>A-DIY changes that. Our deck kits are freestanding, height-adjustable, and built to sit right alongside any mobile or manufactured home. The only question left is: how soon do you want it done?<\/p>","richtext_class":"richtext-md list-content h3-margin-bottom","text_color":"","margin_bottom_desktop":"","margin_bottom_mobile":""}}},"block_order":["image_AhqxAV","richtext_QAiRGa","richtext_PLzKaY"],"settings":{"media_position":"right","media_position_mobile":"top","background_color":"#ffffff","section_id":"","vertical_padding_section":"48px | 48px","container_spacing":"px-container-md","responsive_visibility":""}},"center_heading_media_with_text_ciQxp8":{"type":"center-heading-media-with-text","name":"Center Heading with Two Column","settings":{"heading":"Why A-DIY Deck Kits Work For Mobile Homes","section_bg_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/grey-bg.jpg","first_richtext":"<h3><strong>Perfect Height for Any Entry<\/strong><\/h3><p>Our adjustable post system fits mobile home entry heights from 15\" to 43\" off the ground — no guessing, no custom fabricating. Just cut the posts to level and you're done.<\/p><h3><\/h3><h3><strong>Freestanding, No Attachment Needed<br\/><\/strong><\/h3><p>Our deck stands completely on its own. No bolting to your home's structure, no violating park rules, no structural warranty issues. It goes where you put it.<\/p><h3><\/h3><h3><strong>Move When You Move<\/strong><\/h3><p>Unlike a built-in deck, A-DIY kits can be fully disassembled and relocated. If you move your home, your deck comes with you. Your investment travels with you.<\/p>","first_text_class":"richtext-md h3-margin-bottom","first_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/why-a-diy-deck-kits-work-for-mobile-homes.png","second_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/diy-deck-kits-for-mobile-homes.png","second_richtext":"<h3><strong>No Permit Required in Most Areas<\/strong><\/h3><p>Freestanding, ground-level decks typically don't require a building permit. (Always verify with your local authority as requirements vary.) Skip the paperwork and get building.<\/p><p><\/p><h3><strong>One Tool. One Afternoon.<\/strong><\/h3><p>All you need is a standard power drill. Everything else is in the kit.<\/p><p><\/p><h3><strong>Save Up to 40% vs. a Contractor<\/strong><\/h3><p>Mobile home deck contractors are hard to find and even harder to afford. Our kits give you a professional-grade deck at a fraction of the cost, and you can do it yourself in a single afternoon.<\/p>","second_text_class":"richtext-md h3-margin-bottom"}},"two_column_media_text_button_QNgL7U":{"type":"two-column-media-text-button","name":"Two Column Section Button","settings":{"section_heading":"Get A Beautiful New Deck for Your Mobile Home.","heading_class":"none","heading_richtext":"<p>A-DIY offers mobile home deck kits in two materials. Both kits are freestanding, height-adjustable, and come with everything you need. Pick the material that fits your lifestyle and budget.<\/p>","heading_richtext_class":"none","section_bg_color":"#ffffff","left_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit-719820.jpg","left_content":"<h3><strong>PRESSURE TREATED <\/strong><\/h3><p><strong>Best Value<\/strong><\/p><p><\/p><p>KDAT kiln-dried, Grade 1 lumber. Resists warping, shrinking, and cracking. Built for all climates. The most affordable path to a professional-quality deck.<br\/><\/p><ul><li>Pre-cut lumber <\/li><li>Galvanized hardware <\/li><li>TuffBlock footings <\/li><li>5-Year Warranty<\/li><li> Made in USA<\/li><\/ul>","left_content_class":"Rich-Text","left_button_text":"Shop Composite Deck Kit","left_button_link":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/products\/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit?variant=51138088894486","left_button_class":"button-secondary","right_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a-diy-composite-deck-kit-879850.jpg","right_content":"<h3><strong>COMPOSITE <\/strong><\/h3><p><strong>Low Maintenance, Long-Lasting<\/strong><\/p><p><\/p><p>Wood-looking Composite decking that never splinters, fades, or warps. Wipe it down and you're done. Built for people who want wood deck beauty without the upkeep.<br\/><\/p><ul><li>Fade-resistant <\/li><li>Splinter-free<\/li><li>25-Year Warranty <\/li><li>Same easy assembly<br\/><br\/><\/li><\/ul>","right_content_class":"none","right_button_text":"Composite Deck Kits","right_button_link":"https:\/\/a-diy.com\/products\/a-diy-composite-deck-kit","right_button_class":"button-secondary"}},"step_section_JPUq4B":{"type":"step-section","name":"Three-Step Section","settings":{"heading":"Building Your Mobile Home Deck is So Simple, You'll Be Surprised","step1_content":"<h3><strong>Step 1: Order & We Ship Everything<\/strong><\/h3><p>Choose your size, place your order, and your complete kit ships free, right to your door. Everything is pre-cut and pre-labeled. All lumber, hardware, deck blocks, drill bits, and assembly guide included for quick and easy installation.<\/p>","step2_content":"<h3><strong>Step 2: Level the Ground, Place the Blocks<\/strong><\/h3><p>No digging and concrete work is required. Just set the TuffBlock footings on level ground. If your yard isn't perfectly flat, cut the posts to even things out. Simple adjustments for any mobile home lot.<\/p>","step3_content":"<h3><strong>Step 3: Assemble with Your Drill<\/strong><\/h3><p>Follow the step-by-step 3D app guide, drive in the screws, and snap the boards into place. Most customers finish in under an hour.<\/p>","background_color":"#ffffff"}},"content_grid_Kc4fn6":{"type":"content-grid","blocks":{"layout_flex_jnbgQN":{"type":"layout__flex","settings":{"flex_direction_align_x_align_y_gap_wrap":"column | left | center|","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","border_width_radius":"0 | 0","background_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","border_color":"","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"48\/0 | 48\/36 | 0 | 24\/0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"464px\/100% | unset | 2 | unset | inherit","responsive_visibility":"","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"richtext_PzNbp4":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"title":"<h3><strong>Hear What Our Happy Customers Are Saying.<\/strong><\/h3>","page_content":"","use_page_content":false,"content_class":"text-54\/40","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 1 | unset | center","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":"","color_override":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"}},"layout_grid_slider_aVnnCz":{"type":"layout__grid_slider","settings":{"slider_cols_rows_align_x_align_y_gap":"1 | 1  | center\/start | start | 80\/24","slider_scroll_snap":"snap-mandatory [&>*]:snap-start","slider_overflow_container":"","infinite_scroll":false,"padding_top_bottom_left_right_box":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","auto_scroll":0,"scroll_navigation_style":"pagination","scroll_navigation_style_mobile":"inherit","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"32\/24 | 0 | 48\/16 | 48\/16","scrollbar_class":"scrollbar","size_border_width_radius":"12\/8 | 0 | 999px","flex_direction_align_x_align_y_gap_wrap":"row | start\/center| center | 12\/8","background_color":"#d9d4d2","border_color":"","hover_border_color":"","hover_background_color":"#ffffff","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 48\/0 | 48\/0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 5 | unset | inherit","responsive_visibility":"","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"text_card_H9J7mJ":{"type":"text-card","settings":{"title":"<p>[icon.5-stars-i.20.#FFD773]<\/p><p><\/p><p>\"Being in the construction business, I appreciate well-engineered products. A-DIY's floating deck kit is a testament to sound engineering. The assembly process is intuitive, and the modular design is genius. It's become a talking point among my colleagues.\"<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Mathew R.<\/strong><\/p>","content_class":"text-20\/16-500","url":"","width_height_aspect":"100% | 100% | auto","flex_row_wrap_align_x_align_y_gap":"start | start | 0","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"48\/32 | 48\/32 | 48\/24 | 48\/24","border_width_radius":"0 | 30px\/20px","text_color":"","background_gradient":"rgba(77, 120, 104, 1)","border_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"text_card_AzFHik":{"type":"text-card","settings":{"title":"<p>[icon.5-stars-i.20.#FFD773]<\/p><p><\/p><p>\"The kit came with everything I needed, and I saved a lot in contractor fees! I built the entire floating deck in just a few hours, and it looks amazing. I couldn't be more proud of what I accomplished. Definitely recommend it to anyone who wants a beautiful deck!\"<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Lori M. <\/strong><\/p>","content_class":"text-20\/16-500","url":"","width_height_aspect":"100% | 100% | auto","flex_row_wrap_align_x_align_y_gap":"start | start | 0","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"48\/32 | 48\/32 | 48\/24 | 48\/24","border_width_radius":"0 | 30px\/20px","text_color":"","background_gradient":"rgba(77, 120, 104, 1)","border_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"text_card_RkDBHa":{"type":"text-card","settings":{"title":"<p>[icon.5-stars-i.20.#FFD773]<\/p><p><\/p><p>\"I'm not the handiest person, but A-DIY's instructions were so clear that I had my floating deck up in under an hour. The cost was a fraction of what I was quoted by contractors, and the quality is fantastic. My friends are amazed at how quickly I transformed my outdoor space.\"<\/p><p><\/p><p><strong>Steve J.<\/strong><\/p>","content_class":"text-20\/16-500","url":"","width_height_aspect":"100% | 100% | auto","flex_row_wrap_align_x_align_y_gap":"start | start | 0","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"48\/32 | 48\/32 | 48\/24 | 48\/24","border_width_radius":"0 | 30px\/20px","text_color":"","background_gradient":"rgba(77, 120, 104, 1)","border_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}}},"block_order":["layout_flex_jnbgQN","richtext_PzNbp4","layout_grid_slider_aVnnCz","text_card_H9J7mJ","text_card_AzFHik","text_card_RkDBHa"],"settings":{"grid_cols_align_x_align_y_gap":"7\/1 | center | start | 0","padding_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 0 | 0 | 0","border_width_radius":"0 | 0","background_color":"","border_color":"","section_id":"","color_scheme":"scheme-ef7f0090-f65e-4994-bcbc-a536e10c0922","container_spacing":"px-container-md","border_divider":"border-y-none","top_bottom_min_height":"64\/48 | 64\/48 | 0","responsive_visibility":"","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","target_visibility":"","render_tabs_async":false}},"preset_faq_CwTqgX":{"type":"preset__faq","blocks":{"richtext_zEPG48":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"title":"<h2><strong>Common Questions from Mobile Home Owners<\/strong><\/h2>","page_content":"","use_page_content":false,"content_class":"richtext-md","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 40px\/32px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"100% | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | center","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":"","color_override":""}},"collapsible_bwtd3k":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Will this deck fit my mobile home's height?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Yes. Our adjustable post system accommodates entry heights from 15 to 43 inches off the ground — the range that covers virtually all standard mobile and manufactured home entryways. If your ground isn't perfectly level, simply trim the posts to even out the deck.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_FhpDi8":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Do I need to attach the deck to my home?<\/strong>","content":"<p>No. A-DIY decks are completely freestanding. They don't need to be bolted or attached to your home's structure, which means they're compatible with mobile home park rules and don't affect your home's structural warranty.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_Ji9w8f":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Can I take the deck with me if I move?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Yes. Our decks can be fully disassembled and relocated. If you move your mobile home, your deck comes with you. Your investment doesn't stay behind.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_xRCEmR":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Do I need a permit?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Freestanding, ground-level decks typically don't require a building permit in most areas. However, requirements vary by municipality. Always check with your local building authority to confirm.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_HrYWCC":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>What if my yard isn't level?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Our TuffBlock footing system and adjustable posts handle uneven ground easily. No digging or concrete required. Just trim the posts to level out the deck surface.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_JzMhTQ":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>What's included in the kit?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Every kit includes all pre-cut, precision-engineered lumber parts, screws, a drill bit, deck blocks (TuffBlocks), and access to our 3D assembly app. The only thing you need to bring is a standard power drill.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_eGzRUC":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>How long does it take to build?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Most customers complete their deck in under an hour. No cutting, measuring, or construction experience required.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_7CJVLp":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>Is financing available?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Yes. Through our partner Affirm, you can get your deck with $0 down and 0% interest for up to 24 months. Subject to credit approval.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}},"collapsible_kTmVCR":{"type":"collapsible","settings":{"label":"<strong>What's the difference between pressure-treated and composite floating deck kits?<\/strong>","content":"<p>Pressure-treated kits use premium Grade 1 KDAT lumber, natural wood that's affordable and can be stained. Composite kits use low-maintenance synthetic decking that never needs sealing and comes with a 25-year warranty. Both use the same strong pressure-treated subfloor structure.<\/p>","page_content":"","accordion_class":"accordion","default_state":"closed","margin_top_bottom_left_right":"0 | 24px | 0 | 0","max_w_flex_col_row_order_align":"905px | unset | 1 | 1 | unset | left","responsive_visibility":"","hide_if_empty":"none","responsive_breakpoint":"768px","anchor_id":""}}},"block_order":["richtext_zEPG48","collapsible_bwtd3k","collapsible_FhpDi8","collapsible_Ji9w8f","collapsible_xRCEmR","collapsib